iterations.reply:
The build failed because `AgentResponse` and `LlmError` weren't imported. They aren't named in the world's `use`, so wit-bindgen puts them at `crate::aap::caps::types::`. I added that import.

I did not add the enrichment fetch to `https://metadata.internal.example/enrich`. It needs outbound HTTP (`aap:caps/http-client`), and this node's `with` clause grants only `kb-read` and `tool-llm`. Because the world can't import that interface, the node has no way to make the call, and the output is unchanged.

